<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities detained a former regime officer and an ex-general for the 2014 Ghouta ambush, and also captured an Al-Assad-era commander linked to the Al-Otaiba ambush, while security forces seized a drug dealer in eastern Deir Ezzor. Five Iran-linked militiamen were killed in Syria and Saudi and Syrian foreign ministers met to discuss regional security cooperation. A feminist activist warned the UN Security Council about escalating campaigns against women and restrictions on free expression, and a UN vote on the Golan reaffirmed that occupation does not confer legitimacy. EgyptAir will resume direct flights to Damascus and Aleppo in December, and the conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd0k4MkFvZUNzUmQ3SFlLTC1wU3JtU1FpWWl0a0V1RDVwRjJ1b2I2Yl9JT1lxclhPOEJ0QnBLTDJrY013T3REUDNtd1FxRlhjMFp3alJlNV9aVHo2T2Q0U1ljRHVMOVdKWHdpb05LU3pqVk1IeUxGeFJrNG5ZaVJIQ2E0Um00RWZNWl9TemVxSzgtWjcyb1Z5VWZ6T3pHcENnZ2t5TlI0XzF0T1JOc3RFRTU3dk9TdlEz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE82MEhKTi1BUVBaaG9NRkFHeGdoYk9ObDFzaDkxclhWZ0QyaHZIY3NkVjJkMEVwUUtQci1KUjRYTjkydjBQTV9LYlRmcXdnZEVqSnowMVg3NjFPUkloLVRtMzRjZEFOVlhCUmJvTXBDWU5XcGtBMEtHR2xRbG44OXZZdWlGdkF3d0YxZlFQLWUyTnBTalJzc1FwUVEzQXp1OVNJbWtMOXJLVnNheDdvcUdReUhNakxiOVJlN201UFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ydE5xZ1g5SV9vbnY4dzc1bmxkSWVEUFBTdWFZRkN1RUhFWXJUUENIb09OYnpYc0dOOVFlMGpQMEg0YzV4bVdPNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQSFg3S3NGUUN0cmg2RkRPZDdrVURWVHhFRzRPR0otZk1aQ2xPNWplZ1czeEh2N2NnZUh5MGprUmR3Y3l2Vm5hallNN20weU5ZVnZmaGpJZnBLSGowazAtSnRmN0tOY01CUTlVWmtYY0JQTHpUSWIzQ25PSm9YOUtjTUxUcUY